&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #928374;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;// the transition here is a bit mess to write down but should be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #928374;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;// fairly easy to think or reason about.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
